    "detailed_description": "<h1>Checkout Noosphere On Steam</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156480/extras/4a2d19aeb8a1c03e08ba8426b7374aa1.avif?t=1674100233\" /></div><br><br>Evil Fate is a first person horror game about a man who seeks to set things right again but not without some help. A retro psychological horror with many mysteries and questions to what's happening while trying to find the way out. <br><br>A lone cabin in the middle of the nowhere, those two's relationship isn't simple or pure. Being captured and imprisoned under a mysterious structure, he will have to escape.<br><br>But a evil fate awaits...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156480/extras/ef9cfac9c7166dce39fc0bf5ca258764.avif?t=1674100233\" /></div><br><br>- Retro stylize graphics that takes you back to the 1980s.<br>- Multiple endings depending on how much you discovered.<br>- Figuring out to create the scent and solving the puzzles in order to escape.<br>- Strange and Bizarre, full of mysterious elements.<br><br><strong>Release Date</strong><br>Coming in 2023",
